  },
  {
   "address": 9093,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The menu: prints it (message 7), unhooks the ball, lights choice 1, and waits: UP and DOWN move the choice (1 to 6, wrapping), its line cycling through the colours at $2477; FIRE takes it. Returns the choice in A, the ball hooked again."
  },
  {
   "address": 9118,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Cycles the chosen line's colours a step, every few frames, and reads the controls ($2422) between steps."
  },
  {
   "address": 9152,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The STY operand: the end of the line's colours, $1D, then moved on."
  },
  {
   "address": 9154,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The LDX operand: the colour list's start, moved on a step each time."
  },
  {
   "address": 9191,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A new choice: the old line back to light blue, waits until the stick is let go on all three devices, and points $02/$03 at the new line's colour RAM ($24D7)."
  },
  {
   "address": 9250,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Reads the three devices ($24E5): FIRE returns carry set with A = 0; UP or DOWN moves the choice and returns carry set; nothing returns carry clear."
  },
  {
   "address": 9262,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Joystick two."
  },
  {
   "address": 9335,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The colours the chosen line cycles through: 1 to 10, 13 and 14, repeated."
  },
  {
   "address": 9431,
